  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Social Determinants of Health (SDH) for Gender Equality in Gambella Regional State, Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the contract is to support the Gambella Regional Government to improve health and nutrition of its citizens with specific emphasis on women, adolescent girls and children under five years of age. Specifically, it aims to address other determinants affecting health outcomes in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
